---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /videa/
title: Видеа
description: Полезни видеа за монтаж, обръщане на дограма и поддръжка от ДМД Комфорт.
---
{% from "macros/page-banner.njk" import pageBanner %}

{% call pageBanner() %}
  <div class="eyebrow text-brand before:bg-brand">Видео съдържание</div>
  <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,3.75rem)] font-black leading-none">Полезни видеа</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">Кратки видеа за процеси, съвети и реални обекти.</p>
{% endcall %}

<section class="section-pad bg-brand-mist">
  <div class="container-site grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {% for v in videos %}
      <a class="card reveal group block no-underline" href="{{ ('/videa/' + v.slug + '/') | url }}">
        <div class="relative m-3 aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
          <img class="image-cover" src="{{ v.image }}" alt="{{ v.title }}" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center bg-brand-deeper/25">
            <span class="grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand text-white shadow-lift">▶</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-ink/10 px-5 pb-6 pt-4">
          <h2 class="mb-2 font-display text-xl font-extrabold text-ink group-hover:text-brand">{{ v.title }}</h2>
          <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">{{ v.summary }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
